---
import BaseHead from '../../astro/components/BaseHead.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../../consts';

// 언어 토글 디자인 후보 미리보기 — 선택 후 삭제 예정. noindex + sitemap 제외(/preview/).
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
  <head>
    <BaseHead title={`언어 토글 디자인 후보 | ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="디자인 미리보기" noindex />
  </head>
  <body class="bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900">
    <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12">
      <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mb-2">언어 토글 디자인 후보</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mb-10">
        각 후보를 실제 헤더 톤 위에 올려봤어. 왼쪽 줄 = 한국어 페이지에 있을 때, 오른쪽 줄 = 영어 페이지에 있을 때.
        우측 상단 요소는 실제처럼 검색·테마 아이콘 사이에 끼워놓음. 다크모드로도 전환해서 봐줘.
      </p>

      {/* 공용 마크업 조각: 검색 아이콘 / 테마 아이콘 흉내 */}

      <div class="space-y-10">
        <!-- ① 현재: 세그먼트 -->
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mb-1">① 세그먼트 (현재 적용)</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mb-3">현재 언어가 채워짐. 상태가 보이지만 폭을 좀 차지함.</p>
          <div class="flex gap-4">
            <div class="flex-1 flex items-center justify-end gap-5 h-14 px-4 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 bg-white dark:bg-slate-950">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"></path></svg>
              <a href="#" class="flex items-center rounded-full border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700 text-xs font-semibold overflow-hidden"><span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-slate-200 dark:bg-slate-700 text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">KO</span><span class="px-2 py-0.5 text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-500">EN</span></a>
              <span class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">🌓</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex-1 flex items-center justify-end gap-5 h-14 px-4 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 bg-white dark:bg-slate-950">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"></path></svg>
              <a href="#" class="flex items-center rounded-full border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700 text-xs font-semibold overflow-hidden"><span class="px-2 py-0.5 text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-500">KO</span><span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-slate-200 dark:bg-slate-700 text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">EN</span></a>
              <span class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">🌓</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- ② 지구본 + 라벨 -->
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mb-1">② 지구본 아이콘 + 목적지 라벨</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mb-3">검색·테마 아이콘과 같은 미니멀 톤. 라벨은 "누르면 가는 언어"를 표시 (GitHub 방식).</p>
          <div class="flex gap-4">
            <div class="flex-1 flex items-center justify-end gap-5 h-14 px-4 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 bg-white dark:bg-slate-950">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"></path></svg>
              <a href="#" class="flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-400 dark:hover:text-slate-100 transition-colors"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20"></path><path d="M2 12h20"></path></svg>EN</a>
              <span class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">🌓</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex-1 flex items-center justify-end gap-5 h-14 px-4 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 bg-white dark:bg-slate-950">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"></path></svg>
              <a href="#" class="flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-400 dark:hover:text-slate-100 transition-colors"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20"></path><path d="M2 12h20"></path></svg>KO</a>
              <span class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">🌓</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- ③ 타이포 슬래시 -->
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mb-1">③ 타이포그래피 슬래시</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mb-3">테두리 없이 글자 무게로만 상태 표시. 가장 가볍고 블로그다움.</p>
          <div class="flex gap-4">
            <div class="flex-1 flex items-center justify-end gap-5 h-14 px-4 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 bg-white dark:bg-slate-950">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"></path></svg>
              <a href="#" class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide"><span class="text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">KO</span><span class="text-slate-300 dark:text-slate-600 mx-1">/</span><span class="text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-700 dark:hover:text-slate-300 transition-colors">EN</span></a>
              <span class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">🌓</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex-1 flex items-center justify-end gap-5 h-14 px-4 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 bg-white dark:bg-slate-950">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"></path></svg>
              <a href="#" class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide"><span class="text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-700 dark:hover:text-slate-300 transition-colors">KO</span><span class="text-slate-300 dark:text-slate-600 mx-1">/</span><span class="text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">EN</span></a>
              <span class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">🌓</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- ④ 언더라인 탭 -->
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mb-1">④ 언더라인 탭</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mb-3">현재 언어에 악센트색 밑줄. 내비 링크 hover 스타일과 톤이 이어짐.</p>
          <div class="flex gap-4">
            <div class="flex-1 flex items-center justify-end gap-5 h-14 px-4 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 bg-white dark:bg-slate-950">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"></path></svg>
              <a href="#" class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold"><span class="text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 border-b-2 border-(--color-accent) pb-0.5">KO</span><span class="text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-500 border-b-2 border-transparent pb-0.5 hover:text-slate-700 dark:hover:text-slate-300 transition-colors">EN</span></a>
              <span class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">🌓</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex-1 flex items-center justify-end gap-5 h-14 px-4 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 bg-white dark:bg-slate-950">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"></path></svg>
              <a href="#" class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold"><span class="text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-500 border-b-2 border-transparent pb-0.5 hover:text-slate-700 dark:hover:text-slate-300 transition-colors">KO</span><span class="text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 border-b-2 border-(--color-accent) pb-0.5">EN</span></a>
              <span class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">🌓</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- ⑤ 전체 단어 링크 -->
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mb-1">⑤ 단어 링크</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mb-3">목적지 언어를 그 언어로 표기. 내비 링크(Tech/Life)와 같은 스타일이라 자연스럽지만 토글 느낌은 약함.</p>
          <div class="flex gap-4">
            <div class="flex-1 flex items-center justify-end gap-5 h-14 px-4 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 bg-white dark:bg-slate-950">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"></path></svg>
              <a href="#" class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 hover:text-(--color-accent) transition-colors">English</a>
              <span class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">🌓</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex-1 flex items-center justify-end gap-5 h-14 px-4 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 bg-white dark:bg-slate-950">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"></path></svg>
              <a href="#" class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 hover:text-(--color-accent) transition-colors">한국어</a>
              <span class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">🌓</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- ⑥ 지구본 단독 -->
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mb-1">⑥ 지구본 아이콘 단독</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mb-3">가장 미니멀. 대신 "무슨 언어로 가는지"는 눌러봐야 알 수 있음.</p>
          <div class="flex gap-4">
            <div class="flex-1 flex items-center justify-end gap-5 h-14 px-4 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 bg-white dark:bg-slate-950">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"></path></svg>
              <a href="#" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-400 dark:hover:text-slate-100 transition-colors"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20"></path><path d="M2 12h20"></path></svg></a>
              <span class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">🌓</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex-1 flex items-center justify-end gap-5 h-14 px-4 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 bg-white dark:bg-slate-950">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"></path></svg>
              <a href="#" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-400 dark:hover:text-slate-100 transition-colors"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20"></path><path d="M2 12h20"></path></svg></a>
              <span class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">🌓</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
